# act configuration — run GitHub Actions workflows locally as a SUPPLEMENT.
# act cannot reproduce: GitHub OIDC (keyless cosign), protected Environments
# (release/rc approvals), hosted-runner policy, SARIF upload to code-scanning,
# or real GitHub Release creation. Treat green act runs as "the steps execute",
# NOT as "the release is valid". See .act/README.md.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
--container-architecture linux/amd64
